Name\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[6,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#classic\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Classic Film Pet Names\"}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"li\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[7,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#animated\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Animated Film Names Beyond Disney\"}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"li\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\",\"children\":[8,\".\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#faq\",\"className\":\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}]]}]\n26:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Why Screen-Inspired Names Are So Popular\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"p\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Naming your pet after a beloved movie or TV character is one of the most personal and joyful naming choices you can make. These names carry emotional weight — they connect your companion to stories that have moved you, made you laugh, or shaped your worldview. Every time you call 'Frodo' across the dog park or 'Leia' from the kitchen, you are not just summoning your pet — you are summoning the feelings those characters evoke.\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"p\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Screen-inspired names also serve as social signals. A dog named 'Gandalf' at the dog park announces your love for Lord of the Rings. A cat named 'Ripley' tells visitors you appreciate strong female protagonists. These names are cultural shorthand — they communicate something about who you are and what you love, creating instant connections with fellow fans.\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"p\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"At BestAnimalNames.com, we've curated names from across the cinematic universe — from Disney classics to modern streaming hits — that work beautifully as pet names regardless of whether the person meeting your pet gets the reference. These names sound great on their own; the cultural connection is a bonus.\"]}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Disney & Pixar Pet Names\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Disney and Pixar have created some of the most beloved characters in film history — and many of their names are perfect for pets:\"]}]\n47:T435,<strong>Simba</strong> — The Lion King. Brave leadership. <strong>Nala</strong> — Also Lion King. Loyal and fierce. <strong>Mufasa</strong> — Wise and powerful. <strong>Belle</strong> — Beauty and the Beast. Bookish beauty. <strong>Beast</strong> — For large, gentle pets. <strong>Ariel</strong> — The Little Mermaid. Curious and adventurous. <strong>Olaf</strong> — Frozen. Warm-hearted and funny. <strong>Elsa</strong> — Frozen. Elegant and powerful. <strong>Moana</strong> — Brave and determined. <strong>Maui</strong> — Boisterous and lovable. <strong>Buzz</strong> — Toy Story. Confident and loyal. <strong>Woody</strong> — Also Toy Story. Classic and dependable. <strong>Remy</strong> — Ratatouille. Small but talented. <strong>Dory</strong> — Finding Nemo. Forgetful but endearing. <strong>Nemo</strong> — Finding Nemo. Determined little adventurer. <strong>Stitch</strong> — Lilo & Stitch. Mischievous and lovable. <strong>Merida</strong> — Brave. Independent and spirited. <strong>Pascal</strong> — The loyal chameleon from Tangled.2c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$47\"}}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Star Wars Universe Pet Names\"]}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Star Wars offers some of the most distinctive and powerful names in cinema. Perfect for pets with galactic-sized personalities:\"]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"p\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Luke</strong> — The hero's journey. Classic and aspirational. <strong>Leia</strong> — Strong, regal, and rebellious. <strong>Han</strong> — Charming rogue. <strong>Chewie</strong> — Loyal, furry, and vocal — perfect for fluffy dogs. <strong>Yoda</strong> — Small, wise, and powerful — ideal for small breeds. <strong>Obi-Wan</strong> — Wise mentor (Obi for short). <strong>Anakin</strong> — Passionate and powerful. <strong>Rey</strong> — Resilient and determined. <strong>Finn</strong> — Brave and good-hearted. <strong>Poe</strong> — Dashing and skilled. <strong>Kylo</strong> — Intense and complex. <strong>Vader</strong> — Commanding presence — for pets with dark coats. <strong>Grogu</strong> — The Child (Baby Yoda). Adorable and mysterious. <strong>Mando</strong> — Strong and protective. <strong>Ahsoka</strong> — Wise and agile. <strong>Jyn</strong> — Fierce and determined. <strong>Cassian</strong> — Steadfast and resourceful. <strong>BB-8</strong> — Round, rolling, and lovable.\"}}]\n30:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Marvel Cinematic Universe Names\"]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"The MCU has given us heroes, villains, and sidekicks whose names carry power, humor, and heart:\"]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Tony</strong> — Iron Man. Charming and brilliant. <strong>Pepper</strong> — Steadfast and capable. <strong>Thor</strong> — God of Thunder — for powerful, noble pets. <strong>Loki</strong> — Mischievous and clever. <strong>Natasha</strong> — Black Widow. Fierce and loyal. <strong>Steve</strong> — Captain America. Noble and true. <strong>Bucky</strong> — Loyal protector. <strong>Peter</strong> — Spider-Man. Young and enthusiastic. <strong>Groot</strong> — Says only one thing, means everything. <strong>Rocket</strong> — Small, fierce, and brilliant. <strong>Gamora</strong> — Deadly and loyal. <strong>Shuri</strong> — Genius and lively. <strong>T'Challa</strong> — Majestic and wise. <strong>Carol</strong> — Captain Marvel. Powerful and fearless. <strong>Wanda</strong> — Deeply feeling and powerful. <strong>Vision</strong> — Thoughtful and unique. <strong>Hawkeye</strong> — Sharp and dependable (Hawk for short). <strong>Fury</strong> — Commanding and mysterious.\"}}]\n33:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Fantasy TV Series Names\"]}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Epic fantasy series have created some of the most memorable character names that translate beautifully to pets:\"]}]\n35:[\"$\",\"p\",\"17\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Game of Thrones:</strong> Arya (fierce and determined), Sansa (graceful and resilient), Tyrion (clever and underestimated), Brienne (noble and strong), Ghost (the direwolf — perfect for white pets), Nymeria (independent and protective), Drogon (powerful dragon), Rhaegal (noble dragon), Viserion (golden dragon).\"}}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Lord of the Rings:</strong> Frodo (brave and determined), Samwise (loyal beyond measure — perfect for dogs), Gandalf (wise and powerful), Aragorn (noble leader), Legolas (swift and graceful), Gimli (stout and fierce), Arwen (elven beauty), Eowyn (shieldmaiden — strong and brave), Pippin (curious and mischievous), Merry (loyal and clever).\"}}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"19\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>The Witcher:</strong> Geralt (stoic and skilled), Yennefer (powerful and complex), Ciri (destined and fierce), Jaskier (charming and witty), Roach (Geralt's horse — a humble, loyal name).\"}}]\n38:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Classic Film Pet Names\"]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"p\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Some film characters are so iconic they have become timeless pet names across generations:\"]}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Rocky</strong> — The underdog who fights. <strong>Apollo</strong> — Also Rocky. Confident and powerful. <strong>Indy</strong> — Indiana Jones. Adventurous. <strong>Maverick</strong> — Top Gun. Bold and independent. <strong>Goose</strong> — Loyal wingman. <strong>Ripley</strong> — Alien. Survivor and protector. <strong>Neo</strong> — The Matrix. The One. <strong>Morpheus</strong> — Wise guide. <strong>Trinity</strong> — Powerful and sleek. <strong>Forrest</strong> — Forrest Gump. Pure-hearted. <strong>Holly</strong> — Breakfast at Tiffany's. Chic and iconic. <strong>Ferris</strong> — Ferris Bueller. Charming and clever. <strong>Marty</strong> — Back to the Future. Adventurous. <strong>Doc</strong> — Also Back to the Future. Eccentric genius. <strong>Inigo</strong> — The Princess Bride. Skilled and driven. <strong>Buttercup</strong> — Also Princess Bride. Beloved.\"}}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Animated Film Names Beyond Disney\"]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Non-Disney animation has produced its own roster of memorable characters:\"]}]\n3d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"25\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"<strong>Shrek</strong> — Grumpy exterior, heart of gold — for bulldogs or gruff-looking pets. <strong>Fiona</strong> — Strong and loving. <strong>Donkey</strong> — Chatty and loyal. <strong>Hiccup</strong> — How to Train Your Dragon. Underestimated and brilliant. <strong>Toothless</strong> — Also HTTYD. Fierce but gentle. <strong>Po</strong> — Kung Fu Panda. Enthusiastic and surprising. <strong>Tigress</strong> — Also Kung Fu Panda. Disciplined and powerful. <strong>Kubo</strong> — Kubo and the Two Strings. Creative and brave. <strong>Coraline</strong> — Curious and courageous. <strong>Korra</strong> — The Legend of Korra. Strong-willed and determined.\"}}]\n3e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Explore our name generators for \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"32\",{\"href\":\"/animal/aardwolf/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Aardwolf\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"44\",{\"href\":\"/animal/anthias/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Anthias\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"55\",{\"href\":\"/animal/american-kestrel/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"American Kestrel\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"75\",{\"href\":\"/animal/andean-fox/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Andean Fox\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"93\",{\"href\":\"/animal/amur-leopard/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Amur Leopard\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\"]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"27\",{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\",\"children\":[\"Frequently Asked Questions\"]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"p\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":[\"Discover more naming ideas: \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"28\",{\"href\":\"/animal/eagle/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Eagle\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"37\",{\"href\":\"/animal/watchman-goby/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Watchman Goby\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"54\",{\"href\":\"/animal/orca/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Orca\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"62\",{\"href\":\"/animal/russian-tortoise/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Russian Tortoise\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"82\",{\"href\":\"/animal/chausie/\",\"className\":\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\",\"children\":[\"Chausie\",\" Name Generator\"]}],\", and hundreds more animal name generators.\"]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Will my pet respond to a movie-inspired name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Absolutely. Pets respond to sound and tone, not cultural references. A name like 'Chewie' or 'Yoda' is phonetically clear and distinctive — perfect for pet recognition.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What if the character's personality doesn't match my pet?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"That is often part of the fun. A tiny Chihuahua named 'Thor' or a lazy cat named 'Rocket' creates delightful irony that makes people smile. Names don't have to be literal.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Are there copyright issues with movie-inspired pet names?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"No. Naming your pet after a fictional character is personal use and perfectly legal. Only commercial use of character names (like selling branded pet products) requires licensing.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"What is the most popular movie-inspired dog name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Simba (The Lion King), Loki (Marvel), and Chewie (Star Wars) consistently rank among the most popular movie-inspired dog names across multiple surveys.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Should I use the full character name or a shortened version?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Shorter versions often work better for daily use. 'Obi' instead of Obi-Wan, 'Drog' instead of Drogon, 'Rock' instead of Rocket. But full names are fine if they roll off your tongue easily.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"manta-ray\",{\"href\":\"/animal/manta-ray/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦈\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Manta Ray\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"toyger\",{\"href\":\"/animal/toyger/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐱\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Toyger\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"yellow-bellied-toad\",{\"href\":\"/animal/yellow-bellied-toad/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐸\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Yellow-Bellied Toad\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"spotted-python\",{\"href\":\"/animal/spotted-python/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐍\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Spotted Python\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"giant-clam\",{\"href\":\"/animal/giant-clam/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐚\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Giant Clam\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"blue-jay\",{\"href\":\"/animal/blue-jay/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🐦\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Blue Jay\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"snow-goose\",{\"href\":\"/animal/snow-goose/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦆\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\",\"children\":\"Snow Goose\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"condor\",{\"href\":\"/animal/condor/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl mb-1\",\"children\":\"🦅\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-s